## Tests and exposures

Every model has `not_null` and `unique` tests on its grain, accepted value tests on the kinds and sources, relationship tests from every mart to `int_metro_dim`, and the crosswalk tests described in `docs/geography.md`; the exposures name the story, the explorer, the briefing, the workbook and the BI extracts as the consumers of the marts. The metric layer in `metrics/metrics.yml` defines each metric over the finest grain and over the mart, and `doorstep metrics` fails when the two disagree beyond floating point at any of {{ v('metrics.grains') }} grains.
